WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:18.276
Toad walked through the dungeon.

2
00:00:18.277 --> 00:00:21.325
His heart beat wildly.

3
00:00:21.326 --> 00:00:24.668
"This is crazy," he thought.

4
00:00:24.669 --> 00:00:27.941
"Someone will know it's me."

5
00:00:27.942 --> 00:00:31.418
Toad stepped out into a yard.

6
00:00:31.419 --> 00:00:34.148
Across the yard was a gate.

7
00:00:34.149 --> 00:00:38.748
"No one is stopping me!" thought Toad.

8
00:00:38.749 --> 00:00:42.948
"Washwoman, you're late today," said the guard.

9
00:00:42.949 --> 00:00:46.148
"Here, I'll unlock the door for you."

10
00:00:46.149 --> 00:00:49.018
"It's working!" thought Toad.

11
00:00:49.019 --> 00:00:51.361
"I fooled him!"

12
00:00:51.362 --> 00:00:54.830
Another guard stood at the next gate.

13
00:00:54.831 --> 00:00:58.626
"Give me a hug!" said the guard.

14
00:00:58.627 --> 00:01:01.255
"You work so hard.

15
00:01:01.256 --> 00:01:04.674
This prison is lucky to have you."

16
00:01:04.675 --> 00:01:08.410
Toad was giggling under his bonnet.

17
00:01:08.411 --> 00:01:10.618
He hugged the guard.

18
00:01:10.619 --> 00:01:13.869
The last gate shut behind him.

19
00:01:13.870 --> 00:01:18.140
He was free!

20
00:01:18.141 --> 00:01:22.152
People waved as Toad walked through town.

21
00:01:22.153 --> 00:01:25.346
"Hello, washwoman!" a squirrel called.

22
00:01:25.347 --> 00:01:30.273
"Hello to you!" said Toad in a high voice.

23
00:01:30.274 --> 00:01:33.076
A train whistle blew.

24
00:01:33.077 --> 00:01:36.003
"A train!" cried Toad.

25
00:01:36.004 --> 00:01:38.272
"I'll buy a ticket home!"

26
00:01:38.273 --> 00:01:40.742
Toad ran to the station.

27
00:01:40.743 --> 00:01:45.050
He hurried to the ticket window.

28
00:01:45.051 --> 00:01:49.210
"One ticket to . . ." Toad said, out of breath.

29
00:01:49.211 --> 00:01:52.007
Toad reached under his dress.

30
00:01:52.008 --> 00:01:55.283
He had no pockets.

31
00:01:55.284 --> 00:02:01.526
He had no money!
